<title>POLAND: KPBP-BICK SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>KPBP-BICK SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
